  "text": "כיכר.putString\nכיכר.putString(password if not nullString.String string,byte[] by If notString,byte[] if)byte[]byte[] if String,byte[] bytes,String if byteIndex)nullbyte,byte\netermine.remove确定沙漠\n\nIn this case, we are looking for complex numbers $z$ such that $\\frac{z}{z + 1} + \\frac{z}{z - 1} + \\frac{1}{z}$ is a real number. To approach this problem, we can treat $z$ as a complex variable $a+bi$, where $a$ and $b$ are real numbers. The expression is then expanded and simplified to see when it becomes purely real.\n\nFirst, let's substitute $z = a + bi$ into the expression:\n\n$\\frac{z}{z + 1} + \\frac{z}{z - 1} + \\frac{1}{z} = \\frac{a + bi}{(a + 1) + bi} + \\frac{a + bi}{(a - 1) + bi} + \\frac{a + bi}{a + bi}$\n\nTo simplify this, we need to multiply the numerators and denominators by the conjugates of the denominators:\n\n$\\frac{(a + bi)(a - 1 - bi)}{(a + 1) + bi(a - 1 - bi)} + \\frac{(a + bi)(a - 1 + bi)}{(a - 1) + bi(a - 1 + bi)} + \\frac{1(a - 1)}{a^2 + b^2}$\n\nAfter simplifying further, we get:\n\n$\\frac{a^2 + abi - a - b - ab + a + b + a^2 + abi + ab + a^2 + b^2}{(a + 1)^2 + (b - 1)^2} + \\frac{a^2 + abi - a - b + a - b - ab + a - b + ab + a^2 - b^2}{(a - 1)^2 + (b - 1)^2} + \\frac{a - 1}{a^2 + b^2}$\n\nSimplifying even further:\n\n$\\frac{3(a^2 + b^2 + ab)}{(a + 1)^2 + (b - 1)^2} + \\frac{(a^2 - b^2) + (a - b) - (a^2 - b^2)}{(a - 1)^2 + (b - 1)^2} + \\frac{a - 1}{a^2 + b^2}$\n\nSince the expression must be real, the imaginary parts of the individual terms must cancel out. This means that the terms involving $a$ and $b$ times $i$ must negate each other. Looking at the expression, we can see this happens when:\n\n$3a + 3b - (a - b) = 0$\n\nSimplifying this, we get:\n\n$3a + 3b - a + b = 0$\n\n$2a + 4b = 0$\n\n$a = -2b$\n\nSo, any complex number $z = a + bi$ where $a = -2b$ will make the expression real. In other words, $z$ can be written as $-2b + bi$, or simply $-2i - b$ for real $b$.\n\nThus, the solutions are of the form $z = -2i - b$ for any real number $b$. The final answer in LaTeX format is:\n\n$\\boxed{-2i, -2i + i, -2i + 2i, \\ldots}$\n\n긔",
